  {
   "allow_read_on_all_link_options": 0,
   "default": "0",
   "description": "Data Privacy Consent Statement \n\nYour privacy is important to Sydani Group. This statement (the\u201cPrivacy Statement\u201d) aims at informing you of how Sydani Group will use the information you submit when applying for a job at Sydani Group via the Sydani Group website. What types of information do we process?\nThis Privacy Statement covers any Job Application Data you submit to Sydani Group, such as: \n\u2022 Name, address, email address, telephone number, or other contact information. \n\u2022 Information contained in your CV or cover letter, such as previous work experience, \neducation, or other information you provide for our consideration; \n\u2022 Type of employment sought, desired salary, or other job \npreferences, and \n\u2022 Names and contact information for referrals \nWho may access your data?\nOnly selected employees of Sydani Group - such as your potential future manager(s), employees of the Human Resources Department, and IT (for maintenance purposes only) \nSydani Group will not supply any data to any third party other than those identified above without your express authorization. \nApplicable Laws.\nSydani Group recognizes that certain laws may require stricter standards than those described in the present Privacy Statement. Sydani Group will handle Job Application Data in accordance with local law applicable at the place where the Job Application Data are processed. \nYour Choice.\nProviding your Job Application Data is voluntary. However, if you choose not to provide all of the data that is requested for your application, our ability to consider you as a candidate may be limited. \nFor what purposes will Job Application Data be used?\nThe Job Application Data you provide will be used to assess your application for employment at Sydani Group (or any affiliated Sydani Group entity), to verify your information and conduct reference checks, and to communicate with you and inform you of further career opportunities. \nIf you accept employment with Sydani Group (or an affiliated Sydani Group entity), the information collected will become part of your employment record and will be used for employment purposes. \n\nHow long will we keep your data?\nYour Job Application Data is stored in our applicant\u2019s data base for two (2) years as from your most recent submission of Job Application Data. You can access your Job Application Data, correct it or delete it at any time as explained below. \nYour Consent.\nBy submitting your Job Application Data you are granting your consent to the processing of that information (including to the transfer of your Job Application Data worldwide) in accordance with this Privacy Statement.\n",
